00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.860
Because you're like, they're starving.
因为你会觉得，它们快饿死了。

500
00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:56.800
They've got to eat.
它们必须得吃东西。

501
00:19:57.020 --> 00:19:58.380
And Josh was like, yeah, totally.
然后乔希就说，对，完全赞同。

502
00:19:58.600 --> 00:19:58.740
No.
没有。

503
00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:00.720
And like you look at a squirrel differently.
而且你会用不同的眼光看待松鼠。

504
00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:02.480
Oh, my goodness.
哦，天哪。

505
00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:08.460
Well, Aaron is going to extend an invite to Andy.
嗯，亚伦打算向安迪发出邀请。

506
00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:09.960
And it's a little awkward.
而且这有点尴尬。

507
00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:11.760
They're so awkward.
他们太尴尬了。

508
00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:13.680
The two of them are so awkward.
他们俩真是太尴尬了。

509
00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:14.180
Yeah.
是啊。

510
00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:21.540
I mean, obviously, Andy doesn't want to spend an evening in Gabe's apartment watching him be a couple with Aaron.
我的意思是，很显然，安迪才不想在盖布的公寓里度过一个晚上，看着他跟亚伦秀恩爱呢。

511
00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:23.100
But he can't say no.
但他无法拒绝。

512
00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.600
He says he'll be there.
他说他会去的。

513
00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:27.680
This moves us to the kitchen.
这把我们带到了厨房。

514
00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:33.980
And really, one of my favorite looks from Oscar at four minutes and 29 seconds.
说真的，奥斯卡在四分二十九秒时的一个眼神是我最喜欢的镜头之一。

515
00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.860
I don't know if you noticed it in the background.
我不知道你有没有注意到背景里的他。

516
00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:39.460
Is it when Kevin refers to Gabe as the boss?
是凯文把盖布称为老板的那次吗？

517
00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:40.260
Yes.
对。

518
00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:41.540
It's so amazing.
这太绝了。

519
00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:46.420
So like, you have Daryl and Oscar, and they're making sandwiches on the kitchen counter.
所以你看，达里尔和奥斯卡正在厨房的操作台上做三明治。

520
00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:46.720
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

521
00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:49.040
And then Kevin makes this faux pas.
然后凯文犯了这个失言的错误。

522
00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:49.640
Yes.
对。

523
00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:52.260
Of referring to Gabe as Michael's boss.
管盖布叫迈克尔的上司。

524
00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:52.660
Yeah.
是啊。

525
00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:54.080
And he's like, backpedal, backpedal.
然后他就像是在拼命打圆场。

526
00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:54.600
Yeah.
没错。

527
00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:59.660
And then when Michael goes to ask Daryl and Oscar's opinion about this, they're gone.
然后当迈克尔去征求达里尔和奥斯卡对此的看法时，他们已经不在了。

528
00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:00.760
They've exited.
他们退场了。

529
00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:09.000
There is a tiny moment before that where over Michael's shoulder, you just see Oscar clock, what's going on.
在这之前有一个极短的瞬间，在迈克尔的肩膀上方，你能看到奥斯卡注意到了正在发生的事。

530
00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:10.180
And it's perfect.
简直完美。

531
00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:12.800
It is so, so good.
真的是太棒了。

532
00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:16.500
We're going to travel now to Gabe's apartment.
现在我们要前往盖布的公寓。

533
00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:18.020
It's the evening.
那是晚上。

534
00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:20.240
Erin is giving Michael a tour.
艾琳正在带迈克尔参观。

535
00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.360
She's so enamored with Gabe's apartment.
她太迷恋盖布的公寓了。

536
00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:24.160
It's like a fancy grown-up apartment.
就像一个高级的成年人公寓。

537
00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:25.900
There's big wine glasses, Jenna.
有很大的红酒杯，珍娜。

538
00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:27.600
Very large wine glasses.
非常大的红酒杯。

539
00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:29.140
Which Phyllis is going to enjoy.
菲利斯会很喜欢的。

540
00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:35.920
I had a fun background catch at this entrance moment at four minutes and 45 seconds.
我在四分四十五秒这个进门瞬间捕捉到了一个有趣的背景细节。

541
00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:41.300
You start by seeing an exterior shot of the building, and you hear a door close.
你首先看到的是建筑的外景镜头，然后听到关门声。

542
00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:47.220
And then it cuts to Aaron and Michael, and the apartment door is already closed.
接着镜头切到亚伦和迈克尔，公寓门已经关上了。

543
00:21:47.720 --> 00:21:51.680
It says, if they'd entered, but that way we didn't have to show what was behind the door.
就好像他们已经进去了，但这样我们就不用展示门后面的东西了。

544
00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:52.260
Oh.
哦。

545
00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:55.200
You will see what's behind the door at the end, though.
不过你最后还是会看到门后面是什么。

546
00:21:55.280 --> 00:21:55.900
Movie magic.
电影的魔法。

547
00:21:56.680 --> 00:22:00.920
So Gabe is going to walk Michael through all the toppings for the make-your-own-pizza bar.
所以盖布要带迈克尔看自助比萨吧的所有配料。

548
00:22:01.440 --> 00:22:03.720
There's a really fun thing in deleted scenes, Jenna.
删减片段里有个非常有趣的内容，珍娜。

549
00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:04.740
What is it?
是什么？

550
00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:07.180
Michael wants his own ingredients for the pizza.
迈克尔想要他自己的比萨配料。

551
00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:11.300
He doesn't like all of these amazing ingredients that Gabe has laid out so nicely.
他不喜欢加布摆得这么整齐的这些惊艳食材。

552
00:22:11.800 --> 00:22:15.680
He goes into Gabe's pantry, and he picks out SpaghettiOs.
他走进加布的储藏室，挑了圈圈面罐头。

553
00:22:16.280 --> 00:22:19.900
And Gabe says, I was saving that, you know, for one of the children I mentor.
加布说，我本来留着那个，你知道的，给我的某个辅导对象的。

554
00:22:20.320 --> 00:22:21.780
I remember shooting this.
我记得拍这场戏的时候。

555
00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:22.240
Yeah.
对。

556
00:22:23.520 --> 00:22:28.120
So I remember, because I was, I remember being worried for Steve.
所以我记得，因为我当时，我记得我很为史蒂夫担心。

557
00:22:28.460 --> 00:22:34.180
So Michael makes a pizza with SpaghettiOs as the topping, and he takes this huge bite.
所以迈克尔用圈圈面当配料做一个披萨，然后他狠狠咬了一大口。

558
00:22:34.300 --> 00:22:35.360
I remember this.
我记得这个。

559
00:22:35.440 --> 00:22:35.620
Yes.
是的。

560
00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:39.620
Steve had to take a huge bite out of this pizza topped with SpaghettiOs.
史蒂夫不得不狠狠咬了一大口这个铺满圈圈面的披萨。

561
00:22:39.740 --> 00:22:40.780
It looks so disgusting.
看起来太恶心了。

562
00:22:40.780 --> 00:22:42.200
I thought he was going to gag.
我以为他要作呕了。

