It was a lot.
太难顶了。

1134
00:47:18.060 --> 00:47:20.960
And then also he made him like gently pour beer into his mouth.
然后他还让他轻轻地把啤酒倒进嘴里。

1135
00:47:20.960 --> 00:47:24.480
It was all, it was very, this sound.
总之，真的，这个声音。

1136
00:47:24.480 --> 00:47:25.400
It was so gross.
太恶心了。

1137
00:47:25.620 --> 00:47:26.420
I'm sorry.
我很抱歉。

1138
00:47:26.420 --> 00:47:27.900
I apologize for making the sound.
我为发出这个声音道歉。

1139
00:47:28.060 --> 00:47:28.560
It was gross.
太恶心了。

1140
00:47:29.320 --> 00:47:31.600
But someone needs to go out and talk to Angela.
但得有人出去跟安吉拉谈谈。

1141
00:47:32.620 --> 00:47:36.700
And Dwight says to Pam, she is in heat and she will eat your face off.
然后德怀特对帕姆说，她正处于发情期，会把你的脸啃掉。

1142
00:47:36.920 --> 00:47:38.260
Well, Pam's going to go.
好吧，帕姆得去了。

1143
00:47:38.460 --> 00:47:39.580
She has no choice.
她别无选择。

1144
00:47:39.800 --> 00:47:41.620
She has to keep Dwight there.
她必须把德怀特留在那儿。

1145
00:47:41.920 --> 00:47:42.920
Pam goes.
帕姆去了。

1146
00:47:44.040 --> 00:47:47.000
And Angela, I remember shooting this with you.
安吉拉，我记得当时和你一起拍这场戏。

1147
00:47:47.640 --> 00:47:49.540
Jenna, I was going to say the same thing.
珍娜，我正想说呢。

1148
00:47:49.540 --> 00:47:51.860
I remember every beat of this.
我记得这其中的每一个节拍。

1149
00:47:52.040 --> 00:47:52.480
Everything.
每一个细节。

1150
00:47:52.800 --> 00:47:55.640
Well, it was one of those scenes with just the two of us.
没错，那是只有我们两个人的戏份之一。

1151
00:47:55.720 --> 00:47:58.260
It wasn't a scene with us and then people in the background.
当时没有我们加上背景人群的镜头。

1152
00:47:58.480 --> 00:47:59.760
It was just us.
只有我们。

1153
00:47:59.920 --> 00:48:01.260
It was late at night.
那是深夜。

1154
00:48:01.900 --> 00:48:03.540
We were the last scene of the day.
我们是那天最后一场戏。

1155
00:48:03.720 --> 00:48:04.020
Yeah.
对。

1156
00:48:04.220 --> 00:48:05.700
I remember it so clearly.
我记得太清楚了。

1157
00:48:05.980 --> 00:48:06.200
Same.
我也是。

1158
00:48:06.500 --> 00:48:07.960
But what were you wearing?
但你当时穿的是什么？

1159
00:48:08.160 --> 00:48:10.020
Because it looks like you're wearing nothing.
因为看起来你好像什么也没穿。

1160
00:48:10.380 --> 00:48:11.040
Well, no.
呃，没有。

1161
00:48:11.040 --> 00:48:18.120
I had on like a spandex, strapless, nude-like thing.
我穿得像是一件紧身、无肩带、肉色之类的东西。

1162
00:48:18.120 --> 00:48:18.980
What do you call it?
那叫什么来着？

1163
00:48:19.540 --> 00:48:20.540
Like a bandeau?
就像裹胸？

1164
00:48:20.860 --> 00:48:22.000
Is it a bandeau?
是裹胸吗？

1165
00:48:22.120 --> 00:48:22.820
I don't know.
我不知道。

1166
00:48:23.040 --> 00:48:23.860
I don't know.
我不知道。

1167
00:48:24.180 --> 00:48:24.960
A bustier?
束胸？

1168
00:48:25.660 --> 00:48:28.420
No, a bustier kind of pushes everything up and out.
不对，束胸会把所有东西往上托、往外挤。

1169
00:48:28.660 --> 00:48:28.960
Yeah.
对。

1170
00:48:29.160 --> 00:48:33.280
This was just like a nude-like undergarment.
这只是一件肉色的内衣之类的东西。

1171
00:48:33.540 --> 00:48:33.860
Right.
没错。

1172
00:48:34.320 --> 00:48:35.780
I mean, and jeans.
我是说，还有牛仔裤。

1173
00:48:35.920 --> 00:48:37.460
I had on like jeans because you couldn't see.
我穿着牛仔裤，因为反正也拍不到。

1174
00:48:37.680 --> 00:48:43.320
I was shocked when I watched the scene that Angela had undressed already.
当我看到安吉拉已经脱光衣服的那场戏时，我惊呆了。

1175
00:48:43.320 --> 00:48:44.260
She was ready.
她早就准备好了。

1176
00:48:44.580 --> 00:48:44.940
Yeah.
对。

1177
00:48:45.200 --> 00:48:47.100
Her man is quieting a baby.
她的男人正在哄孩子安静。

1178
00:48:47.760 --> 00:48:48.320
Yeah.
对。

1179
00:48:49.100 --> 00:48:51.780
This gets Angela's clothes off, clearly.
这显然让安吉拉脱掉了衣服。

1180
00:48:52.140 --> 00:48:52.300
Yeah.
对。

1181
00:48:52.820 --> 00:48:57.860
Do you know what I noticed that I didn't think about when we were filming it?
你知道我注意到了什么、而我们在拍的时候却没想到吗？

1182
00:48:57.980 --> 00:48:59.620
And then I watched it and it cracked me up.
然后我看了之后笑死我了。

1183
00:48:59.620 --> 00:49:06.100
In true Angela fashion, she asked Pam her advice and then doesn't like what Pam says and then
延续了安吉拉一贯的作风，她向帕姆征求意见，然后又不喜欢帕姆说的话，接着

1184
00:49:06.100 --> 00:49:07.120
is mad, right?
就生气了，对吧？

1185
00:49:07.300 --> 00:49:07.500
Yeah.
对。

1186
00:49:08.060 --> 00:49:11.660
And then she hits the button and the window slowly goes up.
然后她按了按钮，车窗缓缓升起。

1187
00:49:11.700 --> 00:49:12.020
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

1188
00:49:12.020 --> 00:49:15.460
Which led me to think, she's been sitting in a running car.
这让我想到，她一直坐在发动着的车里。

1189
00:49:15.640 --> 00:49:16.340
Oh, yeah, of course.
哦，对，当然。

1190
00:49:16.340 --> 00:49:19.260
And she's in the back seat of a running car.
而且她在一辆发动着的车的后座上。

1191
00:49:20.160 --> 00:49:22.120
Oh, that's such a good observation.
哦，这观察得太仔细了。

1192
00:49:22.120 --> 00:49:23.360
I didn't notice that.
我没注意到。

1193
00:49:23.480 --> 00:49:24.260
I didn't clock it.
我没留意到。

1194
00:49:25.460 --> 00:49:29.880
Well, also outside is Michael, who was messing with the cable box.
而且外面还有迈克尔，他在摆弄有线电视盒。

1195
00:49:30.080 --> 00:49:31.560
Yeah, he like unplugged everything.
对，他把所有插头都拔了。

1196
00:49:31.780 --> 00:49:32.740
The TV goes off.
电视黑屏了。

1197
00:49:32.840 --> 00:49:33.840
People are really upset.
大家都很生气的样子。

1198
00:49:34.380 --> 00:49:36.560
I would like to point out a continuity moment.
我想指出一个连戏的细节。

1199
00:49:36.980 --> 00:49:40.840
At 17 minutes, 57 seconds, Kevin yells.
在17分57秒的时候，凯文大喊大叫。

1200
00:49:40.840 --> 00:49:42.300
You can hear him in the background.
你能听到他在背景里喊。

1201
00:49:42.520 --> 00:49:43.700
He's like, what's going on?
他就像是，怎么回事？

1202
00:49:44.180 --> 00:49:47.020
But he was in a bedroom eating pigs in a blanket in a blanket.
但他却待在卧室里，裹着毯子吃着迷你热狗卷。

1203
00:49:47.340 --> 00:49:48.440
Oh, you're right.
哦，你说得对。

1204
00:49:49.000 --> 00:49:49.320
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

1205
00:49:49.860 --> 00:49:51.660
Yeah, he's in two places at one.
对，他同时出现在两个地方。

1206
00:49:51.740 --> 00:49:52.660
He's magic Kevin.
他是魔法凯文。

1207
00:49:52.940 --> 00:49:55.300
He wasn't yelling from the bedroom, was he?
他刚才不是在卧室里大喊大叫吗？

1208
00:49:55.480 --> 00:49:56.400
The cable went out.
有线电视断网了。

1209
00:49:56.800 --> 00:49:58.280
Could he still be in the blanket?
他难道还裹着毯子吗？

1210
00:49:58.800 --> 00:49:59.960
Eating pigs in a blanket?
吃着迷你热狗卷？

1211
00:50:00.140 --> 00:50:01.380
They didn't have a TV on in there.
他们里面没开电视。

1212
00:50:01.460 --> 00:50:02.880
Oh, they did have a TV on in there.
哦，他们里面确实开着电视。

1213
00:50:03.000 --> 00:50:03.280
Okay.
好吧。

1214
00:50:03.860 --> 00:50:05.360
Well, then my theory doesn't work.
那我的推论就不成立了。

1215
00:50:06.000 --> 00:50:06.620
Forget it.
算了吧。

1216
00:50:06.820 --> 00:50:07.960
He's not magic Kevin.
他不是魔法凯文。

1217
00:50:08.160 --> 00:50:09.420
He's just loud Kevin.
他只是吵闹的凯文。

1218
00:50:09.600 --> 00:50:10.500
Yeah, I guess so.
对，我猜也是。

1219
00:50:11.240 --> 00:50:13.540
Michael pretends like he doesn't know what's going on.
迈克尔假装不知道发生了什么。

1220
00:50:14.160 --> 00:50:15.160
You know what I love?
你知道我最喜欢什么吗？

1221
00:50:15.400 --> 00:50:18.800
Creed gets off the phone and tells everyone like what happened.
克里德挂了电话后，把发生的事告诉了大家。

1222
00:50:19.040 --> 00:50:19.440
I know.
我知道。

1223
00:50:20.200 --> 00:50:22.480
Michael says he has an idea of how to fix it.
迈克尔说他有个主意能解决这个问题。

1224
00:50:22.580 --> 00:50:24.440
He doesn't know if it'll work, but he'll try.
他不知道管不管用，但他会试试。

1225
00:50:24.780 --> 00:50:28.220
So he's a saboteur and then he's going to be the hero.
所以他先当破坏者，然后又要当英雄。

1226
00:50:28.860 --> 00:50:30.640
I guess that was his whole plan.
我猜这才是他的全盘计划。

1227
00:50:31.560 --> 00:50:43.280
And then Michael and Erin have the scene outside that is so sweet and heartbreaking and funny and tender and odd because, you know, they kind of have this odd dynamic.
然后迈克尔和艾琳在外面那场戏，真的是温馨、心碎、搞笑、温柔又古怪，因为你知道的，他们之间有一种很奇妙的化学反应。

1228
00:50:43.880 --> 00:50:48.520
When Michael realizes he's hurt Erin's feelings by saying, you know, I'm not your dad.
当迈克尔意识到自己说“你知道的，我不是你爸爸”而伤害了艾琳的感情时。

1229
00:50:49.620 --> 00:50:53.780
Then he leans into it and he's like, go to your room.
接着他顺着这个话头说，回你的房间去。

1230
00:50:53.900 --> 00:50:55.440
And she's like, I won't go to my room.
而她却说，我才不回房间呢。

1231
00:50:55.540 --> 00:50:57.240
She's like so quickly gets on board.
她入戏真的好快。

1232
00:50:57.360 --> 00:50:58.580
And it's really sweet.
而且真的很温馨。

1233
00:50:58.580 --> 00:51:01.160
We had a fan question from Bennett C.
我们收到了来自新泽西州泽西市的班内特·C. 的粉丝提问，

1234
00:51:01.260 --> 00:51:09.640
in Jersey City, New Jersey, who said, Erin confronting Michael as he's fixing the cable box is one of the most powerful moments of the entire series.
他说，艾琳在迈克尔修理电视机顶盒时质问他，是整部剧中最有张力的时刻之一。

1235
00:51:09.640 --> 00:51:15.780
Oh, when she says she cares if Michael likes Gabe and he responds, why I'm not your father.
哦，当她说她在乎迈克尔是否喜欢加布，而迈克尔回答说，为什么呀我又不是你父亲。

1236
00:51:16.240 --> 00:51:18.400
Ellie does not have a follow up line.
艾丽接下来没有台词。

1237
00:51:18.400 --> 00:51:23.920
But in the next few seconds, you can see Erin's entire life story move across her face and eyes.
但在接下来的几秒钟里，你能看到艾琳的一生经历从她的脸庞和眼神中掠过。

1238
00:51:24.060 --> 00:51:25.520
It's an amazing scene.
这真是一场精彩绝伦的戏。

1239
00:51:26.260 --> 00:51:27.460
And then Wyatt D.
然后来自肯塔基州的怀亚特·D.

1240
00:51:27.740 --> 00:51:37.620
from Kentucky said this scene with Michael and Erin in particular is incredibly tender and genuine and really exemplifies the role Michael plays in Erin's life.
说，这场迈克尔和艾琳的对手戏尤其令人动容且真挚，真正体现了迈克尔在艾琳生命中扮演的角色。

1241
00:51:37.760 --> 00:51:39.260
This really touched people.
这真的触动了大家。

1242
00:51:39.640 --> 00:51:40.300
And me too.
也触动了我。

1243
00:51:40.460 --> 00:51:47.600
This was the thing about our show where, you know, we cast these people who were always just going to for the comedy moment.
这就是我们这部剧的特点，你知道的，我们选的这些演员，他们一开始往往都是为了喜剧效果而来的。

1244
00:51:47.600 --> 00:51:56.660
And so when they dig deep and give this dramatic performance that's based in this real kind of heartbreak, you know,
所以当他们深入挖掘，奉献出这种基于真实心碎之感的戏剧表演时，你知道的，

1245
00:51:56.740 --> 00:52:00.660
Brian Baumgartner does it as Kevin and then Ellie does it as Erin.
布赖恩·鲍姆加特纳饰演的凯文做到了，接着艾丽饰演的艾琳也做到了。

1246
00:52:01.200 --> 00:52:02.700
It just, wow.
这真的是，哇。

1247
00:52:03.320 --> 00:52:07.840
It just, it takes you by surprise and it grounds the show.
这真的是让人始料未及，也让整部剧变得更加扎实。

1248
00:52:07.840 --> 00:52:09.600
It's one of my favorite things about our show.
这是我最喜欢我们剧的特点之一。

1249
00:52:09.720 --> 00:52:11.440
We say it all the time, but it is.
我们经常这么说，但事实确实如此。

1250
00:52:11.940 --> 00:52:16.080
So many characters over the course of the nine seasons have a moment like this.
在整整九季的进程中，有那么多角色都有过这样高光的时刻。

1251
00:52:16.300 --> 00:52:18.020
And it's always so powerful.
而且那种感觉总是那么强烈。

1252
00:52:18.340 --> 00:52:21.100
And of course, Ellie and Steve just crushed it.
当然了，埃利和史蒂夫表现得太棒了。

1253
00:52:21.280 --> 00:52:27.620
But, you know, as much as Erin needs Michael to be her father, Michael just wants a daughter.
但是，你知道的，尽管艾琳需要迈克尔做她的父亲，迈克尔只是想要一个女儿。

1254
00:52:27.620 --> 00:52:28.320
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1255
00:52:28.520 --> 00:52:29.660
So it's very sweet.
所以这非常温馨。

1256
00:52:29.940 --> 00:52:30.120
Yeah.
是啊。

1257
00:52:30.620 --> 00:52:37.060
Well, and when Michael's saying goodbye to Gabe at the door, he says, I'll kill you if you hurt Erin.
还有，当迈克尔在门口和盖比道别时，他说，如果你敢伤害艾琳，我就杀了你。

1258
00:52:38.180 --> 00:52:42.240
And it's a figure of speech, but he will literally kill him and his entire family.
这虽然是个比喻，但他真的会杀了盖比和他的全家。

1259
00:52:42.240 --> 00:52:45.240
And then he says, that girl's going to turn my hair gray.
然后他说，那个女孩简直要让我急白了头发。

1260
00:52:45.520 --> 00:52:45.920
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1261
00:52:46.420 --> 00:52:47.480
Yeah, it's really sweet.
对，真的很温馨。

1262
00:52:47.900 --> 00:52:49.800
You know what we haven't mentioned?
你知道我们刚才漏掉了什么吗？

1263
00:52:50.080 --> 00:52:50.700
What's that?
什么？

1264
00:52:50.840 --> 00:52:56.140
Is the fact that Andy puked on a maid bed in Gabe's house and covered it with a pillow.
就是安迪在盖比家的一张女佣床上吐了，然后用一个枕头盖住。

1265
00:52:56.320 --> 00:52:57.460
Gabe is going to find that.
盖比迟早会发现的。

1266
00:52:57.480 --> 00:52:58.220
That's so gross.
太恶心了。

1267
00:52:58.220 --> 00:53:02.560
And then Andy's going to end up throwing up at a toilet as Gabe rubs his back.
然后安迪最后趴在马桶上呕吐，盖比在一旁帮他揉背。

1268
00:53:03.040 --> 00:53:05.220
And Gabe's like, you know what we need right now?
盖比还说，你知道我们现在最需要什么吗？

1269
00:53:05.460 --> 00:53:05.900
Yeah.
对。

1270
